Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:10.28,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:12.56,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Frozen, frozen, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No good after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's full of dioxins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I had saved this as evidence a while back...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat it, you malnutritioned kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you want to catch a fraud?\NA matrimonial fraud?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What kinda fraud? Is it big?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Smallest of the small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Spike will be up for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed wants chicken kabobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you taught that you\Nshould wipe your own butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking of who\Nyou remind me of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know now. That guy\Nwith the thin eyebrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitney Hagas Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why I suddenly\Nwas reminded of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know something about\Nmy past that nobody else knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Manley, does she look\Nresuscitated to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she does, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Manley, does she look\Nlike an old woman to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she doesn't, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think she has been\Nsuccessfully defrosted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe so, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Doctor Baccus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Baccus, as in the Baccus that drowned\Nmore humans than Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I used to be an alcoholic.\NBaccus was drowning thanks to Baccus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No problems. You have no wounds left,\Nand the cells are dividing nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... you only have one problem to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a simple process.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The 30 million for the basic operation,\Nand 54 years' worth of interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how much is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,273 million... add to that the hospital fees
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,for a total of 300,028,000 woolongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you pay up that much,\Nyou will be free. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Manley?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She is not acting, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Whitney Hagas Matsumoto, your lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At the request of the Totus Insurance\NCompany, I did some research on your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Faye Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lovely name. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How much of your memory\Ndo you still have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a TV,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a hot water pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is a cellular phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.45,0:06:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,except about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the materials that\Nremain, when you were 20...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,well, you are still 20... you seem to have\Nbeen involved in a serious accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Such that medical technology back then\Ncould not completely cure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally fine, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a scratch on my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean,\N"back then"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That was 54 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been in cold-sleep, or rather\Ncryogenically preserved, to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were able to reawaken now that\Nyou could get the treatment you needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Sleeping Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.93,0:06:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am being serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this is a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it is definitely 2068 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And this isn't a TV
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but a washing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And this isn't a hot water pot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but an automatic\Nface-washing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is not a telephone,\Nbut a thermometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You put this round segment\Nin your mouth— {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You just start saying stuff like that,\Nand you expect me to believe— {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Body temperature: 34.5 degrees Celsius.{\i0}\N{\i1}Pulse: 54. Blood pressure: 40/75.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Still low.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories end back when cellular\Ntelephones still looked like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of accident?!\NWhat was I like before then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. If you get excited, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! What is going to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would you like one?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.61,0:08:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Valentine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do by running away?! {10 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Valentine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pay 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unreasonable for them to\Nchoose to resuscitate me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and then expect me\Nto pay the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know anything about myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take it slow about the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memory might come\Nback to you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep living,\Nyou might meet someone wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What... is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,An ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, if you die,\Nor if you forget yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,they will know who you are\Nand where you're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't have that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The collection agency!\NThe insurance company got impatient!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?! {original: "What are we going to do?!". Extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're both doomed.\NYou should get out of the car and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet up at the\NDoctor's place. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince must protect his sleeping beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We just went through the paperwork. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us to hand you all of his\Nassets if something happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you give us a thumbprint here,\Neverything he owns will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitney...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really cared for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, put your thumb here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the numbers all red?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they say that debt is an asset...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Debt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was stupid back then,\Nnow that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he risked his life to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His debt was nothing compared to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It really wasn't that much...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You were there the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your story was way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a horrible woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that guy is\Nweeping in the afterlife
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,now that you ran away\Nwithout paying the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it. It's not\Na sum that I can pay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're being defiant about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some nerve, alright...\NI'm much older than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:14:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your past is all lies.\NWhat was that about Romani?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make this story up, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's neither a lie, nor a fake. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is known as the "Madam Killer."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's just a cheap\Nmatrimonial fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure doesn't look like one. {9 frames?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can do a good job even by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitney Hagas Matsumoto... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... long time no see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What kinda relationship do they have\Nthat she wants to talk to him alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's a pretty deep relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,An old guy of hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They were made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem very, {\i1}very{\i0} well, Mister Lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because I'm fat?\NIsn't that a biased opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a fat implant after that accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a little incision around\Nthe armpit, and had it squeezed in—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You look healthy, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure you are.\NDid you think it gave you a fresh start? {original: "Yeah, I'm sure you are. Did you think that you completely reinvented yourself by doing that?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to start over.\NStart everything over...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And so you went with matrimonial fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you're a bounty hunter...\NThis must have been destined.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So everyone was in on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I couldn't do anything else.\NBecause he sheltered me, the doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was better to have been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wish for anything more than\Nhaving you hand me over to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's all right\Nto leave them alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You worried about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought that she might let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she have that much\Nsympathy in her heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Women as insistent as her\Ntend to be the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who get emotionally swayed by their exes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:15:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Women don't work on reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So are you the ones that reported to us?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, I want to claim a bounty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Manley, prepare to rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to\Nmeet you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hand you over to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't have to mind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they ready to depart already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she gonna let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be letting him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're splitting it 60-40.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, hurry up, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.99,0:16:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's impossible to get both of us in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe out some more! Exhale!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She took the guy and not the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet captured him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to repay my debt to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have the right to do what I want\Nwith him, and the bounty on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing. She clearly states\Na pointless argument...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you.\NWomen don't work on reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me off of this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Visitor, thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.09,0:17:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was I there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does the truth end,\Nand where do the lies start?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful, I'll hit the pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be easy on you! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're causing me a lot of trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to know your own past?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared for the consequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't really know myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who you really are, where you are from,\Nand where you will go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is a question that every human{\i0}\N{\i1}asks himself at least once in his life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, puberty is the only time you{\i0}\N{\i1}need to worry about things like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only bored individuals think such{\i0}\N{\i1}thoughts after a certain age.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that voice before...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you see me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that... the doctor and the nurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems... that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something like\Nthat doctor passed away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no... I didn't mean it {\i1}that{\i0} way—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You! How many lies do you have\Nto tell before you're satisfied?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You were cryogenically preserved there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That we are certain of. I guarantee it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my past?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gave you the name Valentine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I named you after my favorite song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,As for everything else, all data was\Nlost back in that Gate accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I don't know who you are,\Nor why you were put in cold-sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The patrol ship over there.{\i0}\N{\i1}State your department.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat. The patrol ship over there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}State your department{\i0}\N{\i1}and registration number.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor... at this rate,\Nwe will be apprehended.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.15,0:20:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly unfortunate, but it's best\Nthat we not meddle in this any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, farewell, Whitney. Take care of yourself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're sorry!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Uncle! Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my bounty here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There ya go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're getting paid back\Nfor all the lies that you told.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.41,0:21:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one truth\Nthat I have spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That I fell in love with you\Nwhile you were asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,in love with a sleeping beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lying! It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want me to come back that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure got a big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You were jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a heartless woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't know anything\Nabout my past anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that something that\Nreally doesn't matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that way\Nbecause you have a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.27,0:22:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the past, you still have a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your share... of the 19,800 on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,19,800?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The smallest of the small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't 198,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I put an extra digit in there...
