Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.95,0:23:33.43,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}honto no kanashimi ga shiritai dake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.95,0:23:33.43,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}I only want to know what true sadness is
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.95,0:23:33.43,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}I only want to know what true sadness is
