Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.43,0:23:39.95,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}Sitting in muddy water
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:45.50,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}jinsei mo waruku wa nai
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.09,0:23:45.50,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}jinsei mo waruku wa nai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:45.50,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}isn't such a bad life
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.09,0:23:45.50,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}isn't such a bad life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.21,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.21,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.21,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.50,0:23:54.21,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.18,0:24:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the next episode of Cowboy Bebop, {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.43,0:24:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit, is really heavy and depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.57,0:24:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The only people that show up\Nare well-aged, musty men.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.81,0:24:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say this,\Nbut it is rather lackluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.98,0:24:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Children shouldn't watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies should avoid it, too.
